! The Painter's Substrate ~ Session 0.1 Render Research

''The research locus for the Painter of Words and Light'' — the third Session 0.1 island: the AI
renderer assistant Lares, turning the table's scenes into Midjourney V8.2 prompt-sets and image
boards. This locus holds the whole substrate: three tasked-spirit harvests ''verbatim as handed
back'' (the witness pattern — literal text, never synthesized), the net research on V8.2 and Delos
archaeology, the repo bag-sweep, and the mythology negentropy for the canon gaps.

