## 2. CHARACTER VISUAL CANON

**Lady Aki** (`Shattered Isles/Lady_Aki_Concept_Art_Package_v1.md`, `…Character_Sheet_Roadmap.md:19–23, 211–220`, `…Poster_Sheet_Prompt_v1.md:16–18`):
- True body — `Package:24–29`: "**iridescent fae chitin: violet, seafoam, turquoise, moonlit green**"; "**multiple arms, elegant and ritual-useful rather than monstrous**"; "soft alien face"; "plate-like chitin reads as natural armor"; "spinneret-tool logic at wrists, hips, or back"; "fae, mythic, and sacred rather than horror-grotesque"
- Public glamour — `Package:36–42`: "**red/white miko work outfit**, **silksteel ritual robe layers**, purple or dark outer travel layer, classic wide-brimmed **ichimegasa** with **uchikatsugi-style veil**"; "extra arms hidden, softened, or visually interpreted as **sleeve-folds / shadow / ribbon**"; "**shrine bells, ofuda, sash tools, spinneret kit, small charms at belt**"
- Threshold reveal — `Package:49–54`: "veil lifts or tears aside, **chitin catches light**, extra arms anchor silk lines or hold ofuda, bells and ward papers multiply, **silk geometry defines the room**"
- Palette line (already prompt-shaped) — `Poster_Sheet_Prompt_v1.md:18`: "Mood: **mythpunk, SDM / Vastlands-inspired weird fantasy, shrine-tech, oldtech-magitech, fae glamour**… Palette: **red and white miko robes, purple outer cloth, iridescent chitin, orange mycelium glow, weathered shrine wood/chitin, blue Ephyra glass**"
- Negative direction — `Package:146–152`: "no spider legs on Ichi, no tall ritual hat, **no hypersexual framing**, no final-production polish, no generic witch hat, no modern sci-fi armor replacing shrine/ashigaru language"
- Room-entry blocking — `Package:187–192`: "locals first see veiled miko traveler; careful observers notice **too many sleeve-folds**; hostile pressure makes chitin and extra hands appear"

**Ichi** (`Shattered Isles/Powered_Symbiote_Trait_and_Ichi_Construct_Golem.md`):
- `:115` — "**Compact, practical ashigaru infantry armor. Sergeant's kit** — functional, not decorative. Medium humanoid frame, slightly stocky."
- `:117` — "**Hexagonal kikko-pattern plates of alchemically treated chitin — iridescent beetle-shell blues and greens** — riveted to **woven mycelium-silk backing**. The joins pulse with faint **orange bioluminescent tracery** where the mycelial symbiont threads through the armor **like living mortar**."
- `:119` — "Lamellae of **rare petrified hardwood, lacquered in dark amber resin, laced with silk cord in traditional odoshi style**. Where millennia of dormancy cracked the wood, mycelium has filled the gaps with **glowing orange scar-tissue**."
- `:121` — "Open-faced sergeant's kabuto — forged **orichalcum-alloyed bronze**, modest **shikoro neck guard of chitin lamellae**. The face opening shows **two glowing yellow-orange orbs**."
- `:123` — worn mode: "**eye-spots migrate upward, settling above Aki's brow like a luminous crest**"
- `:96/107/159` — "Spore-daemon-armor symbiote"; "broken ashigaru powered armor — a relic of the **Faerie Court Wars, pre-Necrospire**"
- `:258` — "**Uwa-obi**: thick, often **white**, linen or cotton sash worn over the sarashi"

**Strandbeest-Shrine** (`Shattered Isles/Faerie_Ring_Strandbeest_Shrine_Sheet.md`) — likely out of scope for an interior cabaret, but: `:27` hokora "peaked roof, open front, offering shelf" on articulated legs; `:29` "**Weathered fantascience composite — neither wood nor stone nor metal, but something that reads as all three depending on the light. Orichalcum-inlaid DreamNet glyphs trace the roofline and doorframe, pulsing faintly when the ley-line feed stabilizes.**"; `:33` legs of "**petrified driftwood, chitin segments, mycelium-silk tendons**," "rippling wave-gait," at rest "**folds… like a crab at low tide**"; `:132` "sails unfurl **bioluminescent patterns at night** — mycelium traces glow faintly orange"; `:19` "**Mother Spore's fairy ring glows faintly orange at the shrine's base**"; `:249` "fairy ring **pulses warning orange**"

**Gorgoness crew** — name/role only, NO visual text: `Sidebar_Alpha_Playtest…:37` "**Liv | Gorgonness Captain — bard / sword-mistress, Traveler path**, gorgonne crew / ship pets / personal retainers, small ship"; `:121` "small-ship crew of gorgonnes and pets, Level 1." Also `Elyncia_01:376` "the **Gorgonne Diaspora**." **GAP: no gorgoness appearance canon anywhere.**

**Kai, Prismatic Elf** — `Sidebar_Alpha:35` "**Prismatic Elf Warrior-Ranger Kaiju Stalker** — Hunter/Fighter/Arcane-Archer, **large grimalkin-lynx mount**"; `Package:118–129` "do not let the ranger and Aki merge visually."

**Captain Melantha Vex** (`New Delos/NPCs/Captain_Melantha_Vex.md`) — the ONLY New-Delos-dressed NPC, and the best patron-costume spec in the corpus:
- `:48–54` — "**Third-Oar Syncsuit — black voidsilk, saffron braid, helm-link filaments**"; "**Shipmetal Shirt — bronze-sun scales etched with tide formulae and permit liturgies**"; "**Navigator's Suitcase** — maps, compasses, **route-prisms, tide rings, little lenses, impossible clockwork**"; "**Ray-Bane Navigators — status spectacles**"; "**Pearl-Daemon**"; "**Ghost-Bone Sabre** — elegant officer's blade"; "**Ego Echo Wandpistol**"
- `:148` — "**orichalcum mythpunk: Bronze Age prestige lacquered over strange telecom, divine engineering, and impossible logistics**" (← the master world-dress formula; use verbatim as a style clause)
- `:156` — Pearl-Daemon "a tiny miracle degraded into routine use… from **a warm drop of metal at one ear**"
- `:104` — "arrives looking **expensive, competent, and entirely documented**"

**Telarus** — referee/operator persona, not a rendered character: `Sidebar_Alpha:11–26`; `Elyncia_01:15–38` (`telarus@dreamdeck-enyalius:~$ lares ritual summon --local-instance`, capabilities "Nexus/Admin; Amorphous Dreams Cabal/Admin"). **No physical description.**

**Lindwyrm** — ruler/patron, described only by function: `Elyncia_02:35` "patron of New Delos, bearing **tons of hoarded orichalcum**"; `Elyncia_01:143` "**The Dragon of New Delos**"; `Elyncia_01:331` "the Lindwyrm's flying capital." **GAP: no body, scale, or color canon for the Lindwyrm.**

